%% Architecture Diagram for LangGraph University Assistant
graph TD
    START([__start__]) --> Classifier[Node: classifier]

    %% Classifier conditional routing
    Classifier -->|category == COURSES| Courses[Node: courses_agent]
    Classifier -->|category == PROGRAMMING| Programming[Node: programming_agent]
    Classifier -->|category == MATHEMATICS| Math[Node: mathematics_agent]
    Classifier -->|category == ADMINISTRATION| Admin[Node: administration_agent]
    Classifier -->|category == GENERAL| General[Node: general_agent]
    Classifier -->|category == EMPTY / ERROR| Fallback[Node: fallback]

    %% Tool execution branch
    Courses -->|has tool_calls| Tools[Node: tools / ToolNode]
    Programming -->|has tool_calls| Tools
    Math -->|has tool_calls| Tools
    Admin -->|has tool_calls| Tools
    General -->|has tool_calls| Tools

    %% Tool returns to specific agent
    Tools -->|return to caller| Courses
    Tools -->|return to caller| Programming
    Tools -->|return to caller| Math
    Tools -->|return to caller| Admin
    Tools -->|return to caller| General

    %% Completion
    Courses -->|no tool_calls| END([__end__])
    Programming -->|no tool_calls| END
    Math -->|no tool_calls| END
    Admin -->|no tool_calls| END
    General -->|no tool_calls| END
    Fallback --> END

    %% Memory Checkpointer annotation
    subgraph Persistence [State & Memory Checkpoint]
        Memory[(MemorySaver: thread_id)]
    end

